WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
The rotor turns with the wheel.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
The caliper squeezes friction pads against both faces.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Friction transfers motion energy into heat.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Pad material, temperature and hardware affect real braking.
